  "card": "Makes the default combined fee estimator in estimatesmartfee fall back to the block policy estimate whenever the mempool estimator is unready, instead of failing or returning an error. Changes the mempool estimator to return an error rather than the relay fee floor when the mempool is too sparse to fill block percentiles, preventing severe fee underestimation on nodes with an empty or freshly reset mempool. Additionally, clears the mempool estimator's mined-block history when mempool loading fails at startup to avoid stale estimates, and renames the RPC estimator option from 'none' to 'auto'.",
